# See https://docs.github.com/en/get-started/getting-started-with-git/ignoring-files for more about ignoring files.

# compiled output
dist
tmp
out-tsc
# Exception: the reference control of `check-tokens` carries DELIBERATELY broken
# artifacts (`dist/pct.css` disagreeing with the sources, `dist/tokens.ts` with a hole
# in the union) — that is the entire defect of those two cases, and without it they
# reach CI healthy. The `dist` rule above matches a directory of that name at any
# depth, so without this line the fixtures pass and the gate reports "a prepared input
# PASSED" — firing on something invisible in the repository.
!tools/check-tokens.fixtures/*/libs/tokens/dist/
# the skin copied from libs/tokens/dist so that ng-packagr can take it as an asset
# (assets have to sit inside the project directory) — the source of truth is libs/tokens/src
/libs/components/themes

# dependencies
node_modules

